1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,283
Why are there no snakes in Ireland?

2
00:00:02,633 --> 00:00:05,464
Ireland has green hills, rain, sheep and

3
00:00:05,464 --> 00:00:08,013
plenty of places a snake could live.

4
00:00:08,013 --> 00:00:10,136
Yet it has no native snakes at

5
00:00:10,136 --> 00:00:10,419
all.

6
00:00:10,769 --> 00:00:13,397
The famous legend says Saint Patrick, in

7
00:00:13,397 --> 00:00:16,025
the fifth century, chased all the snakes

8
00:00:16,025 --> 00:00:18,193
into the sea. It's a great story.

9
00:00:18,193 --> 00:00:20,755
But scientists say there were never any

10
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:22,332
snakes for him to chase.

11
00:00:22,682 --> 00:00:24,969
The real reason is the Ice Age.

12
00:00:24,969 --> 00:00:28,141
During the last glacial period, Ireland was

13
00:00:28,141 --> 00:00:30,649
buried under thick ice. It was far

14
00:00:30,649 --> 00:00:34,117
too cold for cold-blooded reptiles like snakes.

15
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:37,271
When the ice melted, about ten thousand

16
00:00:37,271 --> 00:00:40,434
years ago, animals started moving back north

17
00:00:40,434 --> 00:00:43,095
from Europe. But the melting ice also

18
00:00:43,095 --> 00:00:44,173
raised the sea.

19
00:00:44,523 --> 00:00:47,272
The water flooded the land bridge between

20
00:00:47,272 --> 00:00:50,424
Ireland and Britain before snakes could slither

21
00:00:50,424 --> 00:00:53,441
across. Britain kept its connection to Europe

22
00:00:53,441 --> 00:00:55,586
a little longer, which is why it

23
00:00:55,586 --> 00:00:58,469
has three native snake species, and Ireland

24
00:00:58,469 --> 00:00:59,073
has none.

25
00:00:59,423 --> 00:01:03,464
Ireland isn't alone. New Zealand, Iceland, Greenland

26
00:01:03,464 --> 00:01:06,495
and Antarctica also have no native land

27
00:01:06,495 --> 00:01:07,039
snakes.

28
00:01:07,389 --> 00:01:10,360
Ireland is missing other animals too. It

29
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,885
has only one native lizard and one

30
00:01:12,885 --> 00:01:15,633
native frog, and no moles or weasels,

31
00:01:15,633 --> 00:01:17,415
all for the same reason.

32
00:01:17,765 --> 00:01:20,731
There's a similar mystery in Hawaii, which

33
00:01:20,731 --> 00:01:23,415
also has no native land snakes. There,

34
00:01:23,415 --> 00:01:26,169
snakes are treated as a serious threat,

35
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:29,135
because one escaped species could wipe out

36
00:01:29,135 --> 00:01:30,053
native birds.

37
00:01:30,403 --> 00:01:33,488
Saint Patrick is still Ireland's patron saint,

38
00:01:33,488 --> 00:01:36,438
and every March seventeenth, the whole world

39
00:01:36,438 --> 00:01:38,382
turns green to celebrate him.

40
00:01:38,732 --> 00:01:41,222
Historians think the snake story may be

41
00:01:41,222 --> 00:01:43,393
a symbol: the snakes stood for the

42
00:01:43,393 --> 00:01:45,947
old pagan beliefs that Patrick drove out

43
00:01:45,947 --> 00:01:47,735
when he spread Christianity.

44
00:01:48,085 --> 00:01:49,919
Would you move to a country with

45
00:01:49,919 --> 00:01:51,925
no snakes? Tell me in the comments.

